short proof of why Polyak averaging is optimal. Based on this idea, we propose a scalable approximate MCMC algorithm, the Averaged Stochastic Gradient Sampler.\nL37: [abs][cite15†pdf ][cite16†bib ]\nL38: © cite17†JMLR†www.jmlr.org 2017. (cite18†edit†github.com , cite19†beta )\nL39: \nL40: cite20†Mastodon†sigmoid.social "
